pmp:NewThoughtShinnIrresistibleMagnet a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Affirmation of abundance and magnetism"@en, "Affirmation der Fülle und Anziehung"@de ;
    skos:definition "Spoken for the client and then repeated by her continually: an appeal that Infinite Spirit open the way to great abundance, declaring her a magnet for all that is hers by divine right. Purpose: to bring supply."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"divine right\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Game of Life and How to Play It (Marina del Rey, CA: DeVorss & Company, n.d.; copyright 1925, ISBN 0-87516-257-6), The Game, p. 12; read in the proofread transcription Project Gutenberg eBook #74878 (2024), made from the archive.org scan gameoflifehowtop00shin of this printing" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnEightDollarsAndAHunch a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Blessing, hunch and affirmation bring thousands of dollars"@en, "Segen, Eingebung und Affirmation bringen Tausende"@de ;
    skos:definition "Case of the woman with eight dollars: she followed her hunch home, repeated the affirmation, met an old family friend and is said to have obtained thousands of dollars miraculously."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnBlessAndMultiply, pmp:NewThoughtShinnFollowingAHunch, pmp:NewThoughtShinnIrresistibleMagnet ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnPlenty ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
