pmp:NewThoughtShinnWishAndMentalPicture a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Wishing with a momentary mental picture"@en, "Wünschen mit kurzem inneren Bild"@de ;
    skos:definition "Forming a wish and briefly seeing the desired thing arriving, without worry."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Game of Life and How to Play It (Marina del Rey, CA: DeVorss & Company, n.d.; copyright 1925, ISBN 0-87516-257-6), The Game, p. 13; read in the proofread transcription Project Gutenberg eBook #74878 (2024), made from the archive.org scan gameoflifehowtop00shin of this printing" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnRoseTree a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Wish and picture bring the rose-tree"@en, "Wunsch und Bild bringen den Rosenstock"@de ;
    skos:definition "The author wished for a rose-tree one Easter and pictured it coming in; a friend's florist mixed up an order of lilies and delivered a rose-tree, which she ascribes to having set the law going."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnWishAndMentalPicture ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnRighteousDesire ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
