pmc:NewThoughtShinnApparentFailure a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Apparent failure just before achievement"@en, "Scheinbares Scheitern kurz vor dem Erfolg"@de ;
    skos:definition "Announced as a typical pattern: discouragement and seeming failure often come right before a great accomplishment, as Israel feared the giants at the border of the Promised Land."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success announced in advance: the text tells the student to expect it before the outcome."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
