pmc:NewThoughtShinnLuckyMonkeysThrownAway a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Discarding charms and forgiveness restore business"@en, "Verzicht und Vergebung stellen das Geschäft wieder her"@de ;
    skos:definition "The two men threw the monkeys down a coal-hole and business is said to have recovered."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnLawOfForgiveness ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnRubOutMistakes, pmc:NewThoughtShinnSuccessInBusiness ;
