pmc:NewThoughtShinnLadder a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Readiness to pass under the ladder removes it"@en, "Bereitschaft lässt die Leiter verschwinden"@de ;
    skos:definition "Case: a friend who turned back from a ladder in her bank vault resolved to go back and pass beneath it; the ladder had been removed, ending years of bondage to this fear."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnWalkingUpToTheLion ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnFallsAwayOfItsOwnWeight ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
