pmc:NewThoughtShinnSpeakingOfDisease a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Speaking of disease attracts it"@en, "Über Krankheit reden zieht sie an"@de ;
    skos:definition "Because of the vibratory power of words, those who keep talking about illness are said to attract it; after knowing the truth one cannot be too careful of one's words."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:NewThoughtShinnVibratoryForce ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Game of Life and How to Play It (Marina del Rey, CA: DeVorss & Company, n.d.; copyright 1925, ISBN 0-87516-257-6), The Power of the Word, p. 25; read in the proofread transcription Project Gutenberg eBook #74878 (2024), made from the archive.org scan gameoflifehowtop00shin of this printing" .

pmp:NewThoughtShinnNewFashionedChat a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "The new-fashioned chat"@en, "Das neumodische Gespräch"@de ;
    skos:definition "Refusing conversations full of loss, lack, failure and sickness, and instead talking only about what one wants rather than what one does not want."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"new-fashioned chat\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Game of Life and How to Play It (Marina del Rey, CA: DeVorss & Company, n.d.; copyright 1925, ISBN 0-87516-257-6), The Power of the Word, p. 25; read in the proofread transcription Project Gutenberg eBook #74878 (2024), made from the archive.org scan gameoflifehowtop00shin of this printing" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnHealBlessOrProsper a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Words only to heal, bless or prosper"@en, "Worte nur zum Heilen, Segnen, Gedeihen"@de ;
    skos:definition "An old saying is cited that words may serve only healing, blessing or prospering; what one says or wishes for others returns to oneself, so wishing someone bad luck draws bad luck to oneself."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:NewThoughtShinnPowerOfTheWord ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
