pmc:NewThoughtShinnGodInManifestation a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "All men as God in manifestation"@en, "Alle Menschen als Gott in Erscheinung"@de ;
    skos:definition "Every person is held to be God manifested, waiting for the chance to further the divine plan for the life concerned."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Game of Life and How to Play It (Marina del Rey, CA: DeVorss & Company, n.d.; copyright 1925, ISBN 0-87516-257-6), The Law of Nonresistance, p. 32; read in the proofread transcription Project Gutenberg eBook #74878 (2024), made from the archive.org scan gameoflifehowtop00shin of this printing" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnBlessANation a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Blessing a nation disarms it"@en, "Ein Volk segnen entwaffnet es"@de ;
    skos:definition "Sending love to every inhabitant of a nation is said to rob it of power to harm."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnGoodWill ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnAuraOfProtection ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
