pmc:NewThoughtShinnNonresistanceWithWisdom a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Nonresistance only with wisdom"@en, "Nichtwiderstand nur mit Weisheit"@de ;
    skos:definition "Nonresistance must be understood spiritually and used wisely; then, the author replies to students, no one can walk over one."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:NewThoughtShinnLawOfNonresistance ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
