pmc:NewThoughtShinnTelephoneEclipse a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Anxious self-management blocks the awaited call"@en, "Ängstliches Selbstmanagement blockiert den Anruf"@de ;
    skos:definition "The author's own case: resisting all calls while waiting for one, she managed things herself in tension; the receiver was found off the hook for an hour. She blames her anxiety, fear and belief that something might interfere."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmp:NewThoughtShinnUnderGrace fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Game of Life and How to Play It (Marina del Rey, CA: DeVorss & Company, n.d.; copyright 1925, ISBN 0-87516-257-6), The Law of Nonresistance, p. 33; read in the proofread transcription Project Gutenberg eBook #74878 (2024), made from the archive.org scan gameoflifehowtop00shin of this printing" .

pmp:NewThoughtShinnUnderGrace a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Affirming grace over what belongs by divine right"@en, "Gnade für das Zustehende bejahen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Blessing the situation, baptizing it 'success' and affirming that nothing belonging to one by divine right can be lost, since one stands under grace rather than law; alternatively leaving it to Infinite Intelligence that divine ideas never conflict."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"under grace\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Game of Life and How to Play It (Marina del Rey, CA: DeVorss & Company, n.d.; copyright 1925, ISBN 0-87516-257-6), The Law of Nonresistance, p. 33; read in the proofread transcription Project Gutenberg eBook #74878 (2024), made from the archive.org scan gameoflifehowtop00shin of this printing" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnTelephoneReconnected a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Blessing restores the telephone and the calls"@en, "Segen stellt Telefon und Anrufe wieder her"@de ;
    skos:definition "After she blessed the situation, a friend got it reconnected at once, an important call came two minutes later and the awaited one within the hour."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnUnderGrace, pmp:NewThoughtShinnBaptizingEvents ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnFallsAwayOfItsOwnWeight ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
