pmc:NewThoughtShinnRunsAfterHim a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Resisting or fleeing keeps the situation"@en, "Widerstand oder Flucht hält die Lage fest"@de ;
    skos:definition "A situation resisted stays; one fled from follows. Case: a woman fled a domineering mother by marriage and found her husband just like her mother."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnFallsAwayOfItsOwnWeight fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
