pmc:NewThoughtShinnNoEmotionalResponse a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "No emotional response dissolves inharmony"@en, "Keine Gefühlsreaktion löst Disharmonie auf"@de ;
    skos:definition "When one no longer reacts emotionally to an inharmonious situation, it is said to fade from one's path for good, falling away of its own weight."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnAgreeWithThineAdversary ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnFallsAwayOfItsOwnWeight ;
