pmc:NewThoughtShinnTreatmentsToChangeYou a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Treat to change oneself, not others"@en, "Sich selbst behandeln, nicht andere ändern"@de ;
    skos:definition "The author refuses treatments to change a husband or brother; she treats the asker, holding that when one changes the others change. Man's work is always with himself."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:NewThoughtShinnHoldingTheVisionForAnother ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
