pmc:NewThoughtShinnLyingAFailureMethod a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Lying as a failure method"@en, "Lügen als Misserfolgsmethode"@de ;
    skos:definition "Who lies will be lied to, by just the person whose truth one wants. Case: a student who lied found her lover lying, and was cured after living with a worse liar; faults are cured by meeting them in other people, life being a mirror."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnGameOfGivingAndReceiving fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
