pmc:NewThoughtShinnLivingInThePast a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Living in the past"@en, "In der Vergangenheit leben"@de ;
    skos:definition "Dwelling on bygone days is called a method of failure that breaks spiritual law; past and future rob time (Lot's wife). Money cannot be demonstrated while one is pathetic and backward-looking."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnPlenty fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
