    rdfs:label "Preparing for Christmas brings the money"@en, "Weihnachtsvorbereitung bringt das Geld"@de ;
    skos:definition "Case: a woman without money for gifts lived in the now and dug her ditches by buying seals, paper and twine; days before Christmas she received several hundred dollars. The purchases impressed the subconscious with expectancy."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnLiveFullyInTheNow, pmp:NewThoughtShinnDiggingDitches ;
