    rdfs:label "Rhymed affirmation of wonderful work and pay"@en, "Gereimte Affirmation von wunderbarer Arbeit und Lohn"@de ;
    skos:definition "A rhyming statement of having marvellous work (or business) done marvellously, giving marvellous service for marvellous pay; sung or repeated aloud. A rhyme is said to sink easily into the subconscious and there should be perfect pay for perfect service."@en ;
