    rdfs:label "Incompletely worded demand"@en, "Unvollständig formulierte Forderung"@de ;
    skos:definition "An affirmation must cover the whole ground. Case: a needy woman demanded work, got plenty but was never paid; she now adds the clause about pay."@en ;
