    rdfs:label "Plenty as divine right"@en, "Fülle als göttliches Recht"@de ;
    skos:definition "Abundance, more than enough, is God's intention for man; when one tears down the inner walls of lack in one's consciousness the Golden Age comes and every righteous desire is fulfilled."@en ;
