pmc:NewThoughtShinnLordReadAsLaw a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Reading 'Lord' as 'law'"@en, "„Herr“ als „Gesetz“ lesen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Interpretive rule: reading 'Lord' as 'law' clarifies many Bible passages; it is the law, not God, that takes vengeance, while God sees man as perfect."@en ;
