pmc:NewThoughtShinnKarmicDebt a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Strong personal desire can harm others and returns as karma"@en, "Starker Eigenwille kann schaden und kehrt als Karma zurück"@de ;
    skos:definition "Case: a strong-willed woman kept picturing herself in an acquaintance's house; he died and she moved in, but her beloved husband died shortly afterwards and the house became a burden. The author says her desire made way for itself and she paid a karmic debt; the victims were affected only because they were under karmic law."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:NewThoughtShinnImagingFaculty ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
