pmc:NewThoughtShinnPersonalWill a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "What personal will forces is ill-gotten"@en, "Durch Eigenwillen Erzwungenes ist unrecht erworben"@de ;
    skos:definition "Whatever is forced into being by personal will is called ill-got and unlucky; one gets what one wants when one gives up personal will and lets Infinite Intelligence work."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:NewThoughtShinnImagingFaculty ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
