pmc:NewThoughtShinnForcingPersonalWill a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "No right to impose one's will on another"@en, "Kein Recht, anderen den eigenen Willen aufzuzwingen"@de ;
    skos:definition "A mother forbidding a risky trip is told she has no right to force her will on her daughter and that her fear attracts what she fears."@en ;
