pmp:NewThoughtShinnGodsHands a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Putting the situation in God's hands"@en, "Die Lage in Gottes Hände legen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Letting go and taking one's mental hands off a matter: one declares it given over to Infinite Love and Wisdom, blessing it if it is the divine plan and giving thanks that it dissolves if it is not; in sudden perplexity, one simply asks God to take charge because one does not know what to do."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"take your mental hands off\"; \"stand still\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
