pmc:NewThoughtShinnCounterfeitBill a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Forgiveness treatment replaces the bad bill"@en, "Vergebungsbehandlung ersetzt den falschen Schein"@de ;
    skos:definition "The bank apologized and gave her a genuine bill; knowledge of the law gives power to rub out mistakes."@en ;
