pmp:NewThoughtShinnSpendingFearlessly a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Spending fearlessly on a lead"@en, "Furchtlos ausgeben auf Eingebung"@de ;
    skos:definition "Following intuitive leadings to spend or give, fearlessly but wisely, recognizing God as supply rather than seeking lack."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"leadings\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
