pmc:NewThoughtShinnLawOfGrace a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Law of grace transcending karma"@en, "Gesetz der Gnade über dem Karma"@de ;
    skos:definition "The gospel is that a higher law, of grace or forgiveness, frees man from cause and effect; under it one reaps where one has not sown and God's gifts are poured out. This bliss awaits whoever overcomes the race thought of sin, sickness and death."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"law of grace\"; \"under grace\"."@en ;
