    rdfs:label "Overcoming death through the subconscious"@en, "Überwindung des Todes durch das Unterbewusste"@de ;
    skos:definition "She claims science now shows that dying might be conquered by impressing the subconscious with eternal youth and life; working under the superconscious, the body would be resurrected and transformed into Whitman's 'body electric'."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"resurrection of the body\"; \"body electric\"."@en ;
    skos:note "Whitman cited only for the phrase."@en ;
