pmc:NewThoughtShinnEternalYouthStamped a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Stamping the subconscious with eternal life"@en, "Dem Unterbewussten ewiges Leben einprägen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Impressing the conviction of eternal youth on the subconscious under superconscious direction is said to be able to accomplish bodily resurrection."@en ;
