    rdfs:label "Casting lack brings an avalanche of supply"@en, "Mangel abwerfen bringt eine Lawine an Versorgung"@de ;
    skos:definition "Case: a woman in urgent need cast her belief in lack on the superconscious and is said to have received abundant supply."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnCastingTheBurden ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnPlenty ;
