pmc:NewThoughtShinnOldPiano a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Casting the burden places the old piano"@en, "Lastabwurf bringt das alte Klavier unter"@de ;
    skos:definition "Case: a student with no room for a new piano repeated the statement; minutes later a friend phoned asking to rent the old one, which left just before the new one arrived."@en ;
