pmc:NewThoughtShinnLovingHarmoniousHappy a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Freedom from resentment, loving harmony"@en, "Freiheit von Groll, liebevolle Harmonie"@de ;
    skos:definition "Release from long-held resentment and a life of love and harmony."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
