pmc:NewThoughtShinnVisionClears a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Clearing vision and relief while casting the burden"@en, "Klarer Blick und Erleichterung beim Lastabwurf"@de ;
    skos:definition "Announced signs: steady repetition of the casting statement brings clear vision and a feeling of relief, followed sooner or later by manifestation of health, happiness or supply."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success announced in advance: the text tells the student to expect it before the outcome, and announces it for pmp:NewThoughtShinnCastingTheBurden."@en ;
