pmc:NewThoughtShinnCarnalMind a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Doubt and fear poison and attract disaster"@en, "Zweifel und Furcht vergiften und ziehen Unheil an"@de ;
    skos:definition "In the grip of carnal mind no clear vision is possible; doubt and fear poison mind and body and a runaway imagination attracts disaster and disease."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmp:NewThoughtShinnHoldingToTheVision fails."@en ;
