pmp:NewThoughtShinnNoSeparationInDivineMind a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Denial of separation with active faith"@en, "Verneinung der Trennung mit tätigem Glauben"@de ;
    skos:definition "Denying the appearance of separation by affirming that in Divine Mind nothing is separated, so one cannot lose the love and companionship that are one's own; showing active faith by setting a place for the absent spouse at table daily."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
