pmp:NewThoughtShinnMusic a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Impressing the subconscious through music and dance"@en, "Prägung des Unterbewussten durch Musik und Tanz"@de ;
    skos:definition "Using music daily (a gramophone) to come into harmony and free the imagination, or dancing while affirming, so rhythm carries the words forth with power; music is said to have a fourth-dimensional quality that frees the soul."@en ;
