pmc:NewThoughtShinnSignsOfLand a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Signs of land"@en, "Zeichen von Land"@de ;
    skos:definition "Announced: small foretokens always precede a demonstration, like the birds and twigs Columbus saw; students err by taking them for the demonstration itself and becoming disappointed. Case: a cracked plate foreshadowed a full set of dishes, which came soon after."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"signs of land\"; \"day of small things\"."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success announced in advance: the text tells the student to expect it before the outcome."@en ;
