pmp:NewThoughtShinnMakingBelieve a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Making believe one is rich"@en, "So tun, als sei man reich"@de ;
    skos:definition "Continually pretending, like children, to be rich and successful, living in a wondrous world of one's own without envying others."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
