    rdfs:label "Erasing fear before peace"@en, "Furcht tilgen vor Frieden"@de ;
    skos:definition "Neither peace nor happiness is possible until all fear is erased from the subconscious; fear, being energy wrongly aimed, must be redirected and transmuted into faith."@en ;
    pm:dependentStep pmc:NewThoughtShinnPoiseAndJoy ;
    pm:priorStep pmc:NewThoughtShinnFearErased ;
