pmp:NewThoughtShinnGiverAndTheGift a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Thanking God as both Giver and Gift"@en, "Gott dem Geber für Gott die Gabe danken"@de ;
    skos:definition "A recommended statement impressing the subconscious that God is both giver and gift, so one who is one with the giver is one with the gift."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
