pmp:NewThoughtShinnFearOrFaith a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Hourly check of motive: fear or faith"@en, "Stündliche Prüfung: Furcht oder Glaube"@de ;
    skos:definition "Watching oneself every hour to see whether one acts from fear or from faith, and choosing faith."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
