pmc:NewThoughtShinnImmuneToGerms a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Fearlessness gives immunity to germs"@en, "Furchtlosigkeit schützt vor Keimen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Staying fearless among germs is claimed to make one immune."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnWalkingUpToTheLion ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnBodyRenewed, pmc:NewThoughtShinnAuraOfProtection ;
