pmc:NewThoughtShinnAngelInTheMarble a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Saluting the divinity in a cold employer"@en, "Das Göttliche in einer kalten Chefin grüßen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Case: an employee told to salute the divinity in her 'marble' employer and send her love found her kind within a week (anecdote of the sculptor seeing an angel in marble)."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnSalutingTheDivinity ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnLovingHarmoniousHappy, pmc:NewThoughtShinnRightWork ;
