pmc:NewThoughtShinnSorrowRegretRemorse a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Sorrow and remorse damage the body"@en, "Kummer und Reue schädigen den Körper"@de ;
    skos:definition "Sorrow, regret and remorse are said to break down body cells, poison one's atmosphere and create further karma through irritability; mortal mind likes to cling to its griefs."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:NewThoughtShinnKindnessInThePresent ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
