pmp:NewThoughtShinnTreatmentForTheMourner a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Treatment against grief"@en, "Behandlung gegen Trauer"@de ;
    skos:definition "Denying every belief in loss or separation and affirming that God is the mourner's joy, love and peace."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Game of Life and How to Play It (Marina del Rey, CA: DeVorss & Company, n.d.; copyright 1925, ISBN 0-87516-257-6), Love, p. 64; read in the proofread transcription Project Gutenberg eBook #74878 (2024), made from the archive.org scan gameoflifehowtop00shin of this printing" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnNotRespectable a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Denial of loss restores joy"@en, "Verneinung des Verlusts bringt Freude zurück"@de ;
    skos:definition "Case: a mother mourning her daughter regained poise at once and asked that treatment stop because she felt indecently happy."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnTreatmentForTheMourner ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnPoiseAndJoy ;
