pmc:NewThoughtShinnPoiseAndJoy a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Poise and joy in place of grief"@en, "Fassung und Freude statt Trauer"@de ;
    skos:definition "Regaining composure and happiness after loss."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
