pmc:NewThoughtShinnBraggingOfTroubles a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Bragging about troubles"@en, "Mit Sorgen prahlen"@de ;
    skos:definition "A woman who boasted of her troubles always had more to boast of."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnPoiseAndJoy fails."@en ;
