pmp:NewThoughtShinnChildInGodsHands a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Placing a loved one in God's hands"@en, "Einen geliebten Menschen in Gottes Hände legen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Sincerely entrusting one's child or loved one to God, knowing him divinely protected; in alarm, making statements of truth that man is a perfect idea always in his right place and so protected."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
