pmc:NewThoughtShinnBrothersKeeper a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Brother's keeper in thought"@en, "Hüter des Bruders in Gedanken"@de ;
    skos:definition "Each person guards others by his thought and should know that what he loves dwells under the Almighty's shelter (Ps. 91); perfect love casts out fear."@en ;
