pmc:NewThoughtShinnLimitedVision a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Limited vision and fear to act limit supply"@en, "Begrenzte Sicht und Handlungsangst begrenzen Versorgung"@de ;
    skos:definition "A person limits his own supply by narrow vision; sometimes a student realizes wealth but fears to act, whereas vision and action must go together."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnPlenty fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
