pmc:NewThoughtShinnPalmBeach a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Treatment brings three offers and a lead to choose"@en, "Behandlung bringt drei Angebote und Wahlhinweis"@de ;
    skos:definition "Case: the woman soon had three offers; undecided, she woke smelling Palm Beach, took that post and it turned out very successful."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnTreatmentForTheRightPosition, pmp:NewThoughtShinnDefiniteLead ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnRightWork, pmc:NewThoughtShinnLeads ;
