pmc:NewThoughtShinnBakery a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Following an urge leads to someone in need"@en, "Einem Drang folgen führt zu einem Bedürftigen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The author's own case: obeying an unreasoned urge to visit a bakery, she met a woman she had often thought of who needed her help; one often sets out for one thing and comes upon another."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnFollowingAHunch ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnLeads ;
