pmc:NewThoughtShinnRightDecisionsQuickly a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Quick right decisions"@en, "Schnelle richtige Entscheidungen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Being alert and making the right moves without hesitation."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
