pmc:NewThoughtShinnScienceOfNumbers a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Against numerology and astrology"@en, "Gegen Numerologie und Astrologie"@de ;
    skos:definition "The author disputes the 'science of numbers' and horoscope reading, which keep man on the mortal plane since they concern solely the karmic path; a man due to have died by his horoscope is alive and leading a large movement."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"Science of Numbers\"; \"horoscopes\"."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a dispute: the author rejects the practice named; the other side is not read and is entered only as she reports it."@en ;
