pmc:NewThoughtShinnFalseProphecyNeutralized a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Denial neutralizes an evil prophecy"@en, "Verneinung neutralisiert eine böse Prophezeiung"@de ;
    skos:definition "The declaration is offered as the means to neutralize a prediction of evil."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnFalseProphecy ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnAuraOfProtection ;
