pmc:NewThoughtShinnWillOfGod a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Personal will backing God's will"@en, "Eigenwille im Dienst des göttlichen Willens"@de ;
    skos:definition "The human will is to support the universal will and to hold the perfect vision unwavering; God wills every righteous desire. Faith is an effort of will, since fear comes easier (the prodigal son's resolve)."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Game of Life and How to Play It (Marina del Rey, CA: DeVorss & Company, n.d.; copyright 1925, ISBN 0-87516-257-6), Intuition or Guidance, p. 71; read in the proofread transcription Project Gutenberg eBook #74878 (2024), made from the archive.org scan gameoflifehowtop00shin of this printing" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnBoyScouts a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Forgiveness after a warning jolt"@en, "Vergebung nach einem warnenden Stoß"@de ;
    skos:definition "Case: a student mentally condemning a woman was nearly knocked over by boy scouts; she read it as a sign, called on forgiveness and saluted the woman's divinity."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnLawOfForgiveness, pmp:NewThoughtShinnSalutingTheDivinity ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnRubOutMistakes ;
