pmc:NewThoughtShinnReadyForSurprises a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Apparent wrong turns after a demand"@en, "Scheinbare Fehlentwicklungen nach einer Forderung"@de ;
    skos:definition "Announced: after a demand upon the Universal one should expect surprises; things may seem to go wrong while really going right, as an apparent injustice may open the way to the demonstration."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success announced in advance: the text tells the student to expect it before the outcome."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
