pmp:NewThoughtShinnDenyingLoss a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Denial of loss"@en, "Verneinung des Verlusts"@de ;
    skos:definition "After forgiving, denying loss: since nothing is lost in Divine Mind, one cannot lose the sum that is one's by divine right; when a door shuts another opens. Then meeting new injustice undisturbed and blessing the wrongdoer, affirming God as supply."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"deny loss\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
