pmc:NewThoughtShinnTwoThousandDollars a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Denial of loss recovers two thousand dollars"@en, "Verneinung des Verlusts bringt zweitausend Dollar"@de ;
    skos:definition "Case: a woman never repaid two thousand dollars denied the loss; through a lease error and a sale she was paid exactly two thousand dollars to vacate, following a lead to consult her neighbours."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnDenyingLoss ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnRecoveringTheLoss ;
