pmc:NewThoughtShinnLocusts a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Locusts as adverse thoughts"@en, "Heuschrecken als widrige Gedanken"@de ;
    skos:definition "The locusts of Joel 2:25 are read as doubts, fears, resentments and regrets, which alone rob man; nobody gives to or takes from himself but himself."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
