#
# Perfect Self-Expression or the Divine Design
#

pmc:NewThoughtShinnPerfectSelfExpression a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Perfect self-expression as destiny"@en, "Vollkommener Selbstausdruck als Bestimmung"@de ;
    skos:definition "Each person has a place and task only he can fill, held as a flawless idea in the divine mind awaiting recognition; since imagination creates, the idea must be seen before it can manifest. It will feel like play, not labour, and its supply will be provided since each person arrives on earth financed by God."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"perfect self-expression\"; \"Divine Design\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Game of Life and How to Play It (Marina del Rey, CA: DeVorss & Company, n.d.; copyright 1925, ISBN 0-87516-257-6), Perfect Self-Expression or the Divine Design, p. 75; read in the proofread transcription Project Gutenberg eBook #74878 (2024), made from the archive.org scan gameoflifehowtop00shin of this printing" .

pmp:NewThoughtShinnDemandForTheDivineDesign a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Demand for the Divine Design"@en, "Forderung des göttlichen Plans"@de ;
    skos:definition "Man's highest demand: asking Infinite Spirit to open the way for one's life plan to manifest, release the genius within and let one see the perfect plan clearly."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"Divine Design\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Game of Life and How to Play It (Marina del Rey, CA: DeVorss & Company, n.d.; copyright 1925, ISBN 0-87516-257-6), Perfect Self-Expression or the Divine Design, p. 75; read in the proofread transcription Project Gutenberg eBook #74878 (2024), made from the archive.org scan gameoflifehowtop00shin of this printing" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnCyclone a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Design demand brings life changes"@en, "Planforderung bringt Lebensveränderungen"@de ;
    skos:definition "After this demand great changes may occur, since most people have strayed from their design; for one woman it was like a cyclone, followed quickly by new wonderful conditions."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnDemandForTheDivineDesign ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnSquareOfLife ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
