    rdfs:label "Setback when too sure of oneself"@en, "Rückschlag bei zu viel Selbstsicherheit"@de ;
    skos:definition "Trusting personality rather than the Father within brings setbacks. Cases: the boy who relied on himself in history got a poor mark; a traveller guided abroad had everything go wrong at home once she stopped asking for guidance."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmp:NewThoughtShinnOneWithInfiniteIntelligence and pmp:NewThoughtShinnPracticingThePresence fail."@en ;
