pmp:NewThoughtShinnPracticingThePresence a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Practising the Presence of God"@en, "Die Gegenwart Gottes üben"@de ;
    skos:definition "Forming the habit of asking God for guidance and protection at every moment, in small and great things alike (Prov. 3:6)."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"practicing the Presence of God\"."@en ;
