pmc:NewThoughtShinnDictatingTheChannel a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Dictating the channel delays the demonstration"@en, "Den Kanal vorschreiben verzögert die Demonstration"@de ;
    skos:definition "Students often hold back their demonstration by resistance or by dictating the one way it must come, which halts everything; Infinite Intelligence needs a nonresistant instrument."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmp:NewThoughtShinnSpeakingTheWord fails."@en ;
    skos:note "The passage gives “My way, not your way!” as the command of Infinite Intelligence; this is the author's statement of the rule and not a claim that the book's wording comes from another speaker, so no pm:Receiving is entered."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
