pmc:NewThoughtShinnPoise a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Poise"@en, "Gelassenheit"@de ;
    skos:definition "Poise is named the student's goal and is said to be power, since it gives God-Power room to rush through a person; poised, one's thinking is clear and one decides rightly and fast."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
