pmc:NewThoughtShinnAnger a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Anger as cause of disease and wrong decision"@en, "Zorn als Ursache von Krankheit und Fehlentscheidung"@de ;
    skos:definition "Anger is said to blur vision, poison the blood, cause many diseases and lead to wrong, failing decisions; it is one of the worst sins."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnRightDecisionsQuickly and pmc:NewThoughtShinnBodyRenewed fail."@en ;
