    rdfs:label "Belief in incompletion delays demonstration"@en, "Glaube an Unvollständigkeit verzögert die Demonstration"@de ;
    skos:definition "A belief in incompletion, e.g. a habit of leaving things unfinished, trains the subconscious not to complete and delays the demonstration."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmp:NewThoughtShinnSpeakingTheWord fails."@en ;
