pmp:NewThoughtShinnWhichTalent a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Demand to be shown which talent to use"@en, "Bitte, das zu nutzende Talent zu zeigen"@de ;
    skos:definition "With several talents, asking Infinite Spirit for a definite lead revealing one's self-expression and which talent to use now; also affirming that one is completely equipped for one's divine plan and grasping opportunities fearlessly."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Game of Life and How to Play It (Marina del Rey, CA: DeVorss & Company, n.d.; copyright 1925, ISBN 0-87516-257-6), Perfect Self-Expression or the Divine Design, p. 82; read in the proofread transcription Project Gutenberg eBook #74878 (2024), made from the archive.org scan gameoflifehowtop00shin of this printing" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnFullyEquipped a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Being fully equipped for new work"@en, "Voll gerüstet für neue Arbeit"@de ;
    skos:definition "The author has seen people enter new fields suddenly, completely equipped with hardly any training."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnWhichTalent ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnSquareOfLife ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
