pmc:NewThoughtShinnForcingADemonstration a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Forcing a demonstration stalls it"@en, "Erzwingen bringt die Demonstration zum Stillstand"@de ;
    skos:definition "Trying to push a demonstration through by reasoning brings it to a halt; one should act only on intuition or definite leads and wait patiently."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmp:NewThoughtShinnDefiniteLead fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnGameOfLife ;
