pmp:NewThoughtShinnSpiritNeverTooLate a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Speaking the word that Spirit is never late"@en, "Das Wort sprechen, dass der Geist nie zu spät ist"@de ;
    skos:definition "Speaking the word that Spirit is never too late and supply is at hand."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
