    rdfs:label "The word made flesh"@en, "Das Fleisch gewordene Wort"@de ;
    skos:definition "The author predicts that man will reach a stage at which his word materializes at once, the ripe fields appearing immediately as in Jesus' miracles; letting go of the problem is said to bring instantaneous manifestation."@en ;
